\rightarrow W$ be stable at infinity, with reference metric $H_{0}
$, over an asymptotically cylindrical $SU\left( 3\right) -$manifold $W$ as given by the \emph{Calabi-Yau-Tian-Kovalev Theorem \ref{Thm SU(3) mfds}}

