\end{displaymath}  
over each $D_z$ sufficiently far down the tube, for a uniform constant $k'>0$. Choosing $0<\epsilon<1$ and $x>0$, integrating over $A_\epsilon:= I_\epsilon\times S^1$ and applying \emph{Lemma \ref{lemma p-norm and 1-norm}} we have
